<title>BELGIUM: GIB to raise 1996 net dividend 6.7 pct.</title>
<headline>GIB to raise 1996 net dividend 6.7 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgian retail group GIB, which in March announced a 1996 group net profit of 3.4 billion francs, said on Wednesday it would raise its net dividend 6.7 percent to 31.50 francs per ordinary share from 29.50 in 1995.</p>
<p>The net dividend on its reduced withholding tax VVPR shares will also be raised to 35.70 francs from 33.43 francs.</p>
<p>The dividends, which have to be approved by the annual shareholders meeting on June 18, will be paid on June 25.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
